%p
  Dear
  = @recipient.email_name + ','

%p
  You've been invited to view
  %strong
    = @shareable.name
  in the Croucher Foundation data room.

- if @shareable.is_a?(Droom::Folder)
  %p
    %a{href: "#{Settings.url}/shares/#{@share.token}", style: "color:#EE3A43;text-decoration:none;"}
      View folder
- else
  %p
    %a{href: "#{Settings.url}/shares/#{@share.token}", style: "color:#EE3A43;text-decoration:none;"}
      View document

%p
  Best regards,
  %br
  The Croucher Team
